{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2Lhk6Mi2wtMQABpfSZeKUA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:51.156224+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2Lhk6Mi2wtMQABpfSZeKUA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/48zU0Iy94ia1wMiaMt1Dtky727zNHxmTqBKEktCkzf0o61hv5ZdX4JnXPTEY7foLIEGl9OHoicib29W2yicybTWhXUA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>中国科学院大学信息资源管理系</span></p><p><span>2026年全国优秀大学生信息资源管理夏令营活动通知</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span>中国科学院文献情报中心（以下简称“文献中心”）下设中国科学院成都文献情报中心和中国科学院武汉文献情报中心两个二级法人单位，是中国科学院大学研究生培养点之一，依托经济与管理学院建设“信息资源管理系”。拥有图书馆学和情报学硕士、博士学位授予权和博士后科研流动站，师资团队雄厚。设立丰厚奖助学金，毕业生近年就业率接近100%。</span></section><section><span>为了促进全国信息资源管理相关专业优秀大学生之间的交流，文献中心在北京、成都、武汉三地同期举办“中国科学院大学2026年全国优秀大学生信息资源管理科学夏令营”活动。</span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>活动安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>1.时间安排</span></span></section><section><span>本次夏令营历时2天，7月2日至3日举行。</span></section><section><span><span>2、活动内容</span></span></section><section><span>包括开营仪式、招生宣传、学术参观、导师见面会、优秀营员评选等，采取“线上线下相结合”的形式。</span></section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/sbWXM4F6uEWE4bjyC1CgwkEicxeG6Vic9IrvGgiaTwt4tNXqA2CAgTj4w7bFNqUQZjXMyvOicLu9nDleXDlickibibo7bAjrUcMM5SA6aYJxb9XL4k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></section><section><span><span>3、入营人数</span></span></section><section><span>预计100-120人。</span><span><br/></span></section><section><span><span>4、活动费用</span></span></section><section><span>夏令营不收取任何费用，活动期间为每位营员购买保险，集体安排食宿，当地生源营员原则上不安排住宿，其他费用学生自理。</span><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span>可申请夏令营的学生应具备如下条件：</span></section><section><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。诚实守信，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪和受处分记录。</span></section><section><span>2.在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，本科前5/6学期总评成绩在年级名列前茅。</span></section><section><span>3.外语水平良好，原则上须通过大学英语六级考试（CET6≥425，或TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0），具有较强的外语听、说、读、写应用能力。</span></section><section><span>4.具有较强的独立调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></section><section><span>5.身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span>1.提交申请和材料</span></span></section><section><span><span>（1）第一步：准备证明材料原件和扫描件</span></span></section><section><span><span>①本科前5或6学期成绩单，</span><span>原件须加盖公章</span><span>；</span></span></section><section><span><span>②专业排名证明（模板见附件1），</span><span>须加盖教务处或院系公章</span><span>；</span></span></section><section><span><span>③推荐信2封，一封由班主任或辅导员撰写，另一封由副高级及以上职称教师撰写，均须推荐人亲笔签名（模板见附件2）；</span></span></section><section><span><span>④各类证件、证书（含身份证、学生证、获奖证书、英语证书等）扫描件； 可体现自身学术科研水平的科研成果扫描件</span><span>（发表论文需提供期刊封面、目录和论文全文扫描件）</span><span>；</span></span></section><section><span><span>（2）第二步：线上提交申请</span></span></section><section><span><span>请用</span><span>电脑端</span><span>登录中国科学院大学全国优秀大学生信息资源管理夏令营网站（https://edu.scholarin.cn/index）报名，建议采用使用Chrome、Edge、360 浏览器、Safari、火狐、QQ浏览器，不支持手机端，用微信扫码方式登录，扫码后关注中国科讯即可自动进入报名系统。</span></span></section><section><span><span>按照系统要求如实填报个人信息，并在指定栏目提交各项证明材料扫描件及其他证明材料。</span></span></section><section><span><span>考生在系统填报意向导师时，可同时选择北京、成都、武汉三地导师；参营地建议优先选择第一意向导师所在地，也可根据自身情况就近参营。</span></span></section><section><span><span>备注：本次夏令营除实地参观、导师见面环节外，其余活动环节均采用视频三地同步开展。</span></span><section><span><span>2、申请时间</span></span></section><section><span><span>即日起至2026年6月15日。</span></span></section><section><span><span>3、报名系统技术支持</span></span></section><section><span><span>本次夏令营启用全新报名系统，若报名流程遇到问题，可在工作日8:30-17:00联系技术支持协助处理。</span></span></section><section><span><span>联系人：于老师</span></span></section><section><span><span>yushaojie@mail.las.ac.cn</span></span></section><section><span><span>010-82628382转8007</span></span></section><section><span><span>4、加入夏令营群</span></span></section><section><span><span>凡报名本次夏令营的同学需加入QQ群“2026国科大信息资源管理夏令营”，后续有关夏令营的各项通知均会通过本群同步发布。</span></span></section></section></section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sbWXM4F6uEVNq1v60AQs0rhQaIklMr00uRqFgLsJrh0JmibDnwWu7xuwLDqqG9hE3XCI3QtPDAj4BuyWSdnmyfibJfdIFfwJ5LJZoTtRq1bcA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>导师宣介活动</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2026年6月中上旬期间，将安排导师宣介活动，将会介绍研究方向、学生培养情况和招生意向等，具体安排将通过QQ群公布。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>入营通知</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>根据申请人材料进行筛选，预计将在6月22日前以邮件或电话形式发送入营通知，收到通知后请在指定时间内登录报名系统确认是否参营，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>六</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>要求</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1、夏令营活动坚持“安全第一”，请入营同学严格遵守活动纪律，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></p><section><span>2、学生申报材料必须真实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实将通报学生所在学校。</span></section><section><span>3、营员确认入营后无故不得随意退出。如确因特殊情况不能参加本次夏令营，请于6月25日前发邮件至yanjiusheng@mail.las.ac.cn说明情况。</span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>七</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>更多信息请关注</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span>中国科学院文献情报中心研究生教育处：http://www.las.cas.cn/yjsjy2021/zsxx2021/sszs2021/</span><section><span>中国科学院大学招生信息网：https://admission.ucas.ac.cn/</span></section><section><span>中国科学院大学官网：https://www.ucas.ac.cn/</span></section><section><span>中国科学院文献情报中心研究生微信公众号：文情青春</span></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>八</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span>联系部门：中国科学院文献情报中心研究生招生办公室</span><section><span>联系人：迟老师</span></section><section><span>通讯地址：北京市海淀区中关村北四环西路33号；邮政编码：100190</span></section><section><span>联系电话：010-82626389，010-82626611转6723</span></section><section><span>邮箱：zsb@mail.las.ac.cn</span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2026年6月1日</span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2Lhk6Mi2wtMQABpfSZeKUA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1 专业排名证明模板.doc</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2Lhk6Mi2wtMQABpfSZeKUA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2 专家推荐信模板.doc</a></span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1689612069955c2dc12d67c16b278657635481213fc509167c880f59f75506d6","textLength":2055,"sourceSha256":"0d599641f8160b4c85b818795d67ad28b7a572148c7efff50b4109d972add964","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-422a236729255fa991e3","title":"2026年中国科学院信息资源管理系2026年全国优秀大学生信息资源管理夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:51.156224+00:00"}
